{"code":"001470","name":"삼부토건","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"건설","sector_desc":"주택·토목·플랜트 시공. 부동산 경기, 금리, 해외 수주와 원가율이 핵심 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1948년 설립되어 1965년 국내 토목건축공사업 면허 제1호를 취득한 건설업체로, 1976년 기업공개를 하였음. 연결대상 종속회사로 삼부르네상스, 삼부르네상스더힐, 삼부파키스탄 등 10개사를 보유하고 있으며, 2024년 스틸사업부문을 SB C&S에 매각하였음. 국내건설업, 해외건설업, 기타사업부문으로 운영되고 있으며, 국내사업부문이 매출의 99.87%를 차지하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":5820.0,"open":5820.0,"high":5820.0,"low":5820.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":5820.0,"ma60":5820.0,"ma120":5820.0,"ma200":5820.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":null,"high52":5820.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":78.5714,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-1.93,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-69.0,"op_margin_q":-31.3636,"op_qoq":-527.2727,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":77.1523,"rev_yoy":-47.1154,"op_trend_4q":-82.4331,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4646.34,"debt_ratio":181.7,"per":0.01,"pbr":0.03,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.0,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"001470","name":"삼부토건","market":"KOSPI","sector_code":"279","sector_name":"건설","marcap"